      "raw": "```python\nimport json\n\n# Given data\nreadings = [14, 10, 1, 5, 0]\n\n# Calculate the pulse increments\nincrements = []\nfor i in range(1, len(readings)):\n    prev = readings[i-1]\n    curr = readings[i]\n    # Compute the increment, considering wrap-around\n    increment = curr - prev\n    if increment < 0:\n        increment += 16  # Wrap around the 4-bit counter\n    increments.append(increment)\n\n# Create pulses.json as a JSON array of the four pulse increments\nwith open('pulses.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(increments, f)\n\n# Print only their sum\nprint(sum(increments))\n```",
